title: 솔로엔딩_영문
---
And just like that, the semester came to an end.
I tried to win everyone's heart, but all I got in return was a lukewarm response from everyone.
I showed up whenever they asked, and I poured my soul into giving them the answers they wanted... how could they do this to me?
{name()}: Argh, at this rate, I'm going to spend another year solo.
<<wait 1>>
{name()}: This won't do.
I took out my phone and sent the exact same text to all three of them at once.
{name()}: I've liked you since the first club meeting.
{name()}: Let's go out. I'll treat you really well.
{name()}: Well, this should be enough, right?
With that careless thought, I closed my phone and got lost in playing games.
<<wait 1>>
<<play 띠롱띠롱>>
<<wait 1>>
<<play 띠롱띠롱>>
<<wait 1>>
<<play 띠롱띠롱>>
{name()}: What? Why is my phone going off so much?
<<show san_idle>>
ASan: This is... quite flustering.
ASan: Did I ever give you any mixed signals???????
ASan: Sorry... ;;;;;;;;
<<hide>>
<<show pyo_idle>>
EunPyo: I'm sorry.. ㅠㅠ
<<hide>>
<<show hyun_idle>>
NaHyun: You'll treat me well? LOL, doing what?
NaHyun: Focus on yourself first, sweetie~
<<hide>>
{name()}: *Sigh*...
{name()}: Are you kidding me!!!!!!!!!!
Infuriated, I threw my phone onto the bed.
How could every single one of them reject me?
<<play 띠롱띠롱>>
<<play 띠롱띠롱>>
{name()}: Now what?
It was a barrage of KakaoTalk messages in the department group chat with a mysterious EveryClass link, asking if the post was about me.
With a sinking feeling, I clicked the link and saw a post that was already viral.
{name()}: Isn't launching a "confession attack" on three girls in the same major a bit much...?
{name()}: {name()}, Class of '22, Software Department...?
{name()}: How could you even think about sending the exact same confession via mass text...?????
{name()}: No effort, no common sense... I'm. so. em. bar. rassed. to go to the same school as someone like you...???????
<<play 띠롱띠롱>>
<<play 띠롱띠롱>>
{name()}: AAAAAAAAAAAARRRRRRRGH!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
Because the post was on EveryClass with my real name, and I was exposed in the group chat,
I became the infamous "Confession Attack Machine" of the campus....
Everywhere I went, people whispered about me...
Everywhere I went, no one would talk to me...
<<wait 1>>
{name()}: I... I'm taking a leave of absence.
And so, still very much a solo, I had no choice but to submit my leave of absence form...
<<end>>
